equent tweets about them), here are a few of the more recent ones.","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"key":"BZOfIFrPTa"}],"key":"rae3jPwosk"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":18,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"A word of warning: there’s a lot of overlap between these talks - I’m not\ncrazy enough to re-invent the wheel each time I have to speak. However, maybe\nfolks will find some value in the different angles taken in each case.","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":1},"end":{"line":16,"column":1}},"key":"JvAG8sC2Xz"}],"key":"A6MXvFMSSY"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"The Berkeley Data 8 Stack (60 min)","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1},"end":{"line":20,"column":1}},"key":"YSZ2o6Xyoi"}],"identifier":"the-berkeley-data-8-stack-60-min","label":"The Berkeley Data 8 Stack (60 min)","html_id":"the-berkeley-data-8-stack-60-min","implicit":true,"key":"CFgn18RkDy"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":1},"end":{"line":24,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"This talk covers some of the technical infrastructure behind the pedagogical\nefforts here at UC Berkeley. It’s a brief dive into JupyterHub distributions\nand how they fit into an institution like UC Berkeley.","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":1},"end":{"line":22,"column":1}},"key":"RwYeAq27mr"}],"key":"rJQPC0AF57"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":1},"end":{"line":26,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://bit.ly/2019-data8-jupyter","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":1},"end":{"line":26,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"https://​bit​.ly​/2019​-data8​-jupyter","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":1},"end":{"line":26,"column":1}},"key":"HeRmVoMYc3"}],"urlSource":"https://bit.ly/2019-data8-jupyter",